---
description: V2 engineering constraints
alwaysApply: true
---

- Keep the project minimal and LLM-first.
- Do not add tools, dashboard, delivery, RAG, LangGraph, or database unless requested.
- Prefer surgical changes; read only files directly related to the task.
- One focused regression test per bug; do not run the full suite unless requested.
- README stays under 10 lines; no changelogs or architecture docs.
